OL,3,GNEWSARacing driver born without arms
OL,4,Atakes to the track for the first time
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man born without arms has had his
OL,7,Ffirst taste of life as a racing driver,
OL,8,Fafter taking his newly adapted race car
OL,9,Fout on a circuit for the first time.
OL,11,FCallum Smith, 23, was spotted by
OL,12,Frecruiters at Team BRIT earlier this
OL,13,Fyear, but it has taken several months
OL,14,Fto adapt a race car for him, adding a
OL,15,Fsteering wheel that can be controlled
OL,16,Fwith his feet.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,354,350,200,160,0,100
