OL,3,GNEWSARacing driver born without arms
OL,4,Atakes to the track for the first time
OL,5,
OL,6,FNow the rookie driver has had his first
OL,7,Fopportunity to take the car out for a
OL,8,Fspin at Donington race circuit and said
OL,9,Fthe "raw emotion" of the day was "just
OL,10,Fcompletely different to how I had it
OL,11,Fplanned out in my head."
OL,13,F"I don't think there's too many words
OL,14,Fto describe the feelings and the
OL,15,Fsensations of it all", Smith added.
